The staff is, in my opinion, the best weapon for a monk. Since shields 
are so detrimental to monks, the twohandedness of it is no downside. 
It's damage is second only to Grayswandir, which is Lawful and monks are 
restricted in (turns out I eventually got werebane as a gift though). 
Regeneration is a huge plus to a monk, especially one with the 600 hp I 
had. It makes the longer fights more survivable. Level drain is 
extremely powerful in some cases, and the staff also protects vs it. 
Invoking the staff unslimes and heals as well, good for emergencies.


